{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01780","headline":"杂曲歌辞 行路难三首 一 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 行路难三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金尊清酒斗十千，玉盘珍羞直万钱。\n停杯投筯不能食，拔劒四顾心茫然。\n欲渡黄河冰塞川，将登太行雪暗天。\n闲来垂钓坐溪上，忽复乘舟梦日边。\n行路难，行路难，多岐路，今安在？\n长风破浪会有时，直挂云帆济沧海。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01780.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01780","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"周啸天"}